pe":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2,"position":[1152,-160],"id":"0fa5a910-5e38-405b-a232-02eebc4e791d","name":"Agregar archivo al bucket","disabled":true},{"parameters":{"text":"Se exportaron todos los flujos correctamente","additionalFields":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-144,480],"id":"af1458f2-47b0-458d-99e4-307a1ec7c1b7","name":"Send a text message","webhookId":"9ebfe787-37a4-4291-91c3-6e58be5dac80","disabled":true},{"parameters":{"operation":"write","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[1152,-16],"id":"55716477-d6a7-49f9-8ede-b237bb8e0828","name":"Read/Write Files from Disk","disabled":true},{"parameters":{"resource":"file","owner":{"__rl":true,"value":"LeonardoMuranodev","mode":"name"},"repository":{"__rl":true,"value":"backups-automaticos","mode":"list","cachedResultName":"backups-automaticos","cachedResultUrl":"https://github.com/LeonardoMuranodev/backups-automaticos"},"filePath":"=backups/{{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.name }}.json","binaryData":true,"commitMessage":"=Agregando el backup del archivo {{ $('Loop Over Items').item.json.name }}.json"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.github","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[704,176],"id":"a831ced4-4ef4-483f-9967-12bc7ad75553","name":"Create a file","webhookId":"a4ec5627-111d-4356-a995-4f4ba9f4a20c","credentials":{"githubApi":{"id":"BAaLDDKlM394GnIo","name":"GitHub backups"}}},{"parameters":{"content":"## 🤖 SISTEMA DE AUTO-BACKUP\n\nEste flujo descarga todos tus workflows y los guarda en GitHub automáticamente.\n\n**Pasos Lógicos:**\n1. ⏱️ Se activa una vez por semana.\n2. 📥 Descarga los datos de tu n8n.\n3. 🔄 Sube los archivos uno por uno.\n4. Envia una notificacion final por Telegram","height":272,"width":576,"color":5},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-384,-512],"id":"be278421-3122-4486-bda9-4222ff754f82","name":"Sticky Note"},{"parameters":{"content":"### 🔑 CREDENCIAL N8N\n\nNecesitas crear una **n8n API Key**.\n\n1. Ve a `Settings` > `API`.\n2. Crea una Key nueva.\n3. **Importante:** En la credencial, si usas Docker/Desktop, la URL base suele ser:\n\n`http://localhost:5678/api/v1`","height":480,"width":384,"color":3},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-1120,-160],"id":"b153acc0-a0e8-43c9-9238-2e6713b4fb0e","name":"Sticky Note1"},{"parameters":{"content":"### 🔄 BUCLE (LOOP)\n\nAquí usamos un nodo **\"Split In Batches\"**.\n\n**¿Por qué?**\nEn lugar de intentar subir 50 archivos juntos y saturar GitHub, los procesamos **de 1 en 1**.","height":480,"width":384,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-704,-160],"id":"ed5d75e4-7fdc-4f3c-8efa-5182c676e61f","name":"Sticky Note2"},{"parameters":{"content":"### 📄 DE TEXTO A ARCHIVO\n\nEl nodo anterior nos da texto (JSON).\nEste nodo lo transforma en un **\"Archivo Binario\"** virtual.\n\nEs como si le diéramos \"Guardar como...\" a cada texto.","height":480,"width":384,"color":6},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-288,-160],"id":"7d360fdd-58ca-429a-bd21-0cb1806521f3","name":"Sticky Note3"},{"parameters":{"content":"### ✋ FRENO (RATE LIMIT)\n\n**Wait Node:** Espera 2 segundos.\n\n**Razón:**\nGitHub tiene un límite de velocidad. Si subimos muy rápido, nos bloquean por spam. Esto le da \"aire\" a la API.","height":480,"width":384,"color":3},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[128,-160],"id":"e412c92b-8e6d-4d54-aac4-aca659e65efa","name":"Sticky Note4"},{"parameters":{"content":"### ☁️ SUBIDA A GITHUB\n\n**Configuración de Credencial:**\nEn GitHub, ve a Settings (Ajustes de tu perfil) -> Developer Settings.\nElige Personal access tokens -> Fine-grained tokens\nRepository access: Selecciona \"Only select repositories\" y eleji el repo del backup.\nPermissions: Despliega \"Repository permissions\" y busca Contents.\nCambiar a Read / Write\n**Configuración del Nodo:**\n* **Resource:** File\n* **Operation:** Create / Update\n* **File Path:** `backups/{{ $json.name }}.json`","height":480,"width":384,"color":7},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[560,-160],"id":"041cb8c5-1faa-406a-ab76-a9ea6a69ce3f","name":"Sticky Note5"},{"parameters":{"content":"### ☁️ OTRAS OPCIONES DE ALMNACENAMIENTO\n\n","height":576,"width":464,"color":2},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[976,-256],"id":"62bf76b8-c404-4247-95d5-547644792093","name":"Sticky Note6"}],"connections":{"Get many workflows":{"main":[[{"node":"Loop Over Items","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Loop Over Items":{"main":[[{"node":"Send a text message","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Convert to File","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Schedule Trigger":{"main":[[{"node":"Get many workflows","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Convert to File":{"main":[[{"node":"Wait","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Wait":{"main":[[{"node":"Create a file","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Agregar archivo al bucket":{"main":[[]]},"Create a file":{"main":[[{"node":"Loop Over Items","type":"main","index":0}]]}},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1","binaryMode":"separate","availableInMCP":false},"staticData":null,"meta":null,"pinData":{"Create a file":[{"json":{"content":{"name":"Backups-Automaticos.json","path":"backups/Backups-Automaticos.json","sha":"a2bf405d321dc067fa83758b3b566e8c9127c4b5","size":4310,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonardoMuranodev/backups-automaticos/contents/backups/Backups-Automaticos.json?ref=main","html_url":"https://github.com/LeonardoMuranodev/backups-automaticos/blob/main/backups/Backups-Automaticos.json","git_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonardoMuranodev/backups-automaticos/git/blobs/a2bf405d321dc067fa83758b3b566e8c9127c4b5","download_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LeonardoMuranodev/backups-automaticos/main/backups/Backups-Automaticos.json","type":"file","_links":{"self":"https://api.github.com/repos/LeonardoMuranodev/backups-automaticos/contents/backups/Backups-A